===Adjective===
'''российский''' (rossíjskij) {{m}}

#[[Russian]] (concerning the country, nationality)

See [[русский]] (concerning ethnicity and others). Unlike '''русский''', the word '''российский''' highlights belonging to Russia, no matter what ethnicity, in some cases both words are used interchangeably.

